 "remarks": "Welcome to easy, move-in-ready living in the charming Silvermine neighborhood! Located in the lovely Riverbend Common community, this beautifully maintained 2-bedroom, 2.5-bath townhouse offers a spacious and versatile layout with an additional loft, perfect for a home office, guest space, or second living area. Enjoy peaceful pond views, a cozy fireplace, and beautifully updated bathrooms. An attached garage adds everyday convenience, while the turnkey condition means you can simply move right in and enjoy! Ideally situated just minutes from shopping, restaurants, and everyday essentials, with easy access to major highways and the train for commuting. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy comfortable, low-maintenance living in one of Norwalk's most convenient locations!",
